=2 Walkthrough
* Easily soloable mission.
* After confirming the mission with {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}, go to a Windurstian controlled {p:Campaign} area **in the Northlands** and talk to the {p:Gate Sentry}.

=3 List of Gate Sentries
* {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)}: G-6
* {z:Xarcabard (S)}: J-9

* Your mission is to escort two NPCs named "Reinforcement" to the {p:Campaign NPC|Category:Campaign NPC} of the zone.
** If you get too far away from either NPC, she will say a line of dialogue and proceed to run either on her own back towards the Gate Sentry or ahead at random, depending on her personality.
*** This will also happen periodically even if you're right next to her.
** You can regain control of the NPC by talking to her again.

=3 List of Campaign NPCs
* {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)}: I-8
* {z:Xarcabard (S)}: H-8

* Once you've arrived at the {p:Campaign NPC|Category:Campaign NPC}, talk to them to complete the escort quest and receive your experience points.
** If a {p:Campaign Battle} is currently in progress, the NPC will stand there, but not despawn. You will have to wait for it to finish for the mission to be counted as a success.
* After returning and talking to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}, you gain the {p:Allied Notes} and the mission is complete.

